he lightning almost snatches away their sight. Every time it lights [the way] for them, they walk therein; but when darkness comes over them, they stand [still]. And if Allāh had willed, He could have taken away their hearing and their sight. Indeed, Allāh is over all things competent.","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"2:21","t":"O mankind, worship your Lord, who created you and those before you, that you may become righteous -","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"2:22","t":"[He] who made for you the earth a bed [spread out] and the sky a ceiling and sent down from the sky, rain and brought forth thereby fruits as provision for you. So do not attribute to Allāh equals while you know [that there is nothing similar to Him].","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"2:23","t":"And if you are in doubt about what We have sent down [i.e., the Qur’ān] upon Our Servant [i.e., Prophet Muḥammad (ﷺ)], then produce a sūrah the like thereof and call upon your witnesses [i.e., supporters] other than Allāh, if you should be truthful.","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"2:24","t":"But if you do not - and you will never be able to - then fear the Fire, whose fuel is people and stones, prepared for the disbelievers.","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":24,"sd":null}],"juz":1,"hizb":1,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}